1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:11,380
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say maybe, instead say absolutely - because people certainty

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:14,460
closes, maybe kills.

4
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:21,240
Don't say customer, instead say client - clients feel like partners, customers feel

5
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,510
like numbers.

6
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:30,150
Don't say problem, instead say concern - concerns get solved, problems get blamed.

7
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:36,810
Don't say cheap, instead say affordable - affordable feels smart, cheap feels risky.

8
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:43,470
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - agreements are mutual, contracts feel

9
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,640
one-sided.

10
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:50,020
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

